WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.835 --> 00:00:15.045
"Watch this!" said Poppy.

2
00:00:15.046 --> 00:00:18.961
She took a deep breath.

3
00:00:18.962 --> 00:00:33.492
Bang! Her trunk flew open.

4
00:00:33.493 --> 00:00:42.250
Balloons flew out!

5
00:00:42.251 --> 00:00:46.017
Honk! Honk! Poppy tooted her horn.

6
00:00:46.018 --> 00:00:49.647
Eddy laughed hard.

7
00:00:49.648 --> 00:00:53.051
His dumper shook.

8
00:00:53.052 --> 00:00:56.411
"What's your name?" asked Poppy.

9
00:00:56.412 --> 00:00:58.545
Eddy told her.

10
00:00:58.546 --> 00:01:04.162
Two trucks rolled over.

11
00:01:04.163 --> 00:01:07.448
"Eddy," said Poppy.

12
00:01:07.449 --> 00:01:10.556
"Meet Dipper and Jeb."

13
00:01:10.557 --> 00:01:15.695
"I'm an ice cream truck," said Dipper.

14
00:01:15.696 --> 00:01:24.839
"I play music."

15
00:01:24.840 --> 00:01:28.753
"I move dirt," said Jeb.

16
00:01:28.754 --> 00:01:34.634
He rolled off the lot.

17
00:01:34.635 --> 00:01:41.607
He scooped some dirt.

18
00:01:41.608 --> 00:01:44.844
"Hey, Eddy," said Jeb.

19
00:01:44.845 --> 00:01:47.591
"Want to carry this dirt?"

20
00:01:47.592 --> 00:01:50.395
"No, thanks," said Eddy.

21
00:01:50.396 --> 00:01:53.002
"I don't like to carry dirt."

22
00:01:53.003 --> 00:01:56.202
Everyone looked surprised.

23
00:01:56.203 --> 00:02:03.050
"What do you like to do?" asked Dipper.

24
00:02:03.051 --> 00:02:06.218
Eddy grinned.

25
00:02:06.219 --> 00:02:10.946
"I like to race!"
